WEBVTT

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.803
Insert / Edit Structure (Ctrl+Shift+K)와 3D Structure (Mol*)로 2D·3D 구조를 삽입합니다.

00:00:01.833 --> 00:00:02.803
